        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Hi!",
         "transl": "Привіт!"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Ah, hello\\..\\..\\.. a \\v[lore.title.seeker], is it?",
         "transl": "Ah, hallo\\..\\..\\.. Ein Seeker, richtig?"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "lab.scientist-pc",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "[nods]",
         "transl": "[nickt]"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "NOD"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Neat.\\. Very nostalgic.\\. \\..\\..\\.. Can I help you with anything?",
         "transl": "Ah, cool.\\. So nostalgisch.\\. \\..\\..\\.. Kann ich dir irgendwie helfen?"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "lab.scientist-pc",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "...",
         "transl": "..."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "THINKING"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "How?",
         "transl": "Як?"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "SURPRISED_TOWARD"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Ah, well.\\. Our old project kinda went South after those armed birds broke out.",
         "transl": "Ach so, na ja.\\. Unser altes Projekt ging leider den Bach runter, nachdem diese bewaffneten Vögel ausgebrochen sind."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "lab.scientist-pc",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Suddenly there were birds with weapons all over \\v[lore.title.planet].\\. That wrecked our reputation a bit.",
         "transl": "Die waren plötzlich überall, auf ganz Shadoon.\\. Das hat unseren Ruf ein wenig runiniert."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "lab.scientist-pc",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "...",
         "transl": "..."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "SMILE"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Anyway, I'm now working with my colleagues on this small passion project.\\. Not as fancy or profitable but very satisfying.",
         "transl": "Jedenfalls arbeiten wir gemeinsam an unserem kleinen Traum weiter.\\. Nicht so pompös oder gewinnbringend wie zuvor, aber sehr erfüllend."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "lab.scientist-pc",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Just having a nice time with some neat creatures and gaming with my peers.\\. Good stuff.",
         "transl": "Einfach aus Freude an der Sache. Jetzt hindert uns auch niemand mehr am Zocken.\\. Genau unser Ding."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "lab.scientist-pc",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Lea!",
         "transl": "Лія!"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "EXCITED"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Yes.\\. On that note, I am kinda busy kicking butt.\\. Are we done?",
         "transl": "Ja.\\. Und ich gewinne gerade haushoch...\\. Wenn's dir also nichts ausmacht..."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "lab.scientist-pc",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "... bye.",
         "transl": "... Бувай."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "SMILE"
        }
       }
      ]
