        }
       },
       {
        "name": {
         "orig": "Dave Halman",
         "transl": "Dave Halman"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "lab.scientist-ps4",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Hi!",
         "transl": "Привіт!"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "A \\v[lore.title.seeker]?\\. Fascinating.\\. You must have a lot of stories to tell.\\. Wisdom to share.",
         "transl": "Ein Seeker?\\. Faszinierend.\\. Du hast bestimmt viel zu erzählen.\\. Und Erfahrung gesammelt, die du weitergeben kannst."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "lab.scientist-ps4",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "...",
         "transl": "..."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "THINKING"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Sorry.",
         "transl": "Вибач."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "NERVOUS"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "That's fine.\\. Sometimes not consciously knowing can give you a clearer view on things, \\v[lore.title.seeker].",
         "transl": "Schon in Ordnung.\\. Manchmal kann es einem eine klarere Sicht auf die Dinge geben, wenn es einem gar nicht bewusst ist, Seeker."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "lab.scientist-ps4",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Preconception, propaganda, all of that can hide the real answers from your mind.",
         "transl": "Vorurteile, Meinungsmache, all das kann dich von den wahren Antworten in deinem Inneren ablenken."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "lab.scientist-ps4",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "...",
         "transl": "..."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "SURPRISED_AWAY"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Well, right now is not the best time to talk.\\. Such heavy topics deserve a few hours of undivided attention.",
         "transl": "Tja, ist gerade kein guter Zeitpunkt zum Reden.\\. Solch schwere Themen brauchen ihre Zeit und volle Aufmerksamkeit."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "lab.scientist-ps4",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "... wait.",
         "transl": "... Зачекай."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "NERVOUS"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Maybe later, \\v[lore.title.seeker]?",
         "transl": "Vielleicht später, Seeker?"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "lab.scientist-ps4",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "... b-bye.",
         "transl": "... B-Bye."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "SURPRISED"
        }
       }
      ]
     },
