        }
       },
       {
        "name": {
         "orig": "Drey Santrés",
         "transl": "Drey Santrés"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "lab.scientist-switch",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Hi!",
         "transl": "Привіт!"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Welcome, \\v[lore.title.seeker].\\. Did you visit one of our facilities?",
         "transl": "Willkommen, Seeker.\\. Hast du eine unserer Anlagen besucht?"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "lab.scientist-switch",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "[nods]",
         "transl": "[nickt]"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "NOD"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Very nice.\\. I'm happy that you enjoyed it and hope that you will also like what we have built here.",
         "transl": "Sehr schön.\\. Freut mich, dass es dir gefallen hat und ich hoffe, dass dir auch gefällt, was wir hier geschaffen haben."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "lab.scientist-switch",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "...",
         "transl": "..."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "SURPRISED_TOWARD"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "It is a smaller thing, but something we are very passionate about.",
         "transl": "Keine große Sache, aber etwas, das uns sehr am Herzen liegt."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "lab.scientist-switch",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "... how?",
         "transl": "... Як?"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "SURPRISED_AWAY"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Despite the accident, we still had funds and a lot of connections.\\. Enough to raise another small facility together.",
         "transl": "Trotz des Unfalls hatten wir immer noch Geldmittel und viele Verbindungen. Genug, um gemeinsam eine kleine neue Anlage aufzubauen.<<A<<[CHANGED 2021/05/22]"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "lab.scientist-switch",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "... why?",
         "transl": "... Чому?"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "SURPRISED_TOWARD"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "We all became big fans of those fascinating creatures and wanted to give them a peaceful life here.",
         "transl": "Die faszinierenden Geschöpfe sind uns einfach ans Herz gewachsen und wir wollten ihnen hier ein friedliches Leben ermöglichen."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "lab.scientist-switch",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "... how?",
         "transl": "... Як?"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "PROUD"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "We learned a lot in the previous project.\\. So we are now able to run this new place in harmony with the Track, without any incidents.",
         "transl": "Wir haben durch das Projekt viel gelernt.\\. Dadurch können wir die neue Anlage hier im Einklang mit dem Pfad betreiben - ohne Zwischenfälle."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "lab.scientist-switch",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "... why?",
         "transl": "... Чому?"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "WHISTLING"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "\\v[lore.title.seeker], I am tired and playing this game against my colleagues.",
         "transl": "Seeker, ich bin müde und spiele gerade gegen meine Kollegen."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "lab.scientist-switch",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Please stop asking questions and let me smash their pride.",
         "transl": "Also bitte, keine Fragen mehr. Ich bin nämlich grad dabei, ihren Stolz zu brechen."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "lab.scientist-switch",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Bye.",
         "transl": "Бувай."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "SMUG"
        }
       }
      ]
     },
